                "text": "My colleagues and I are demanding answers from Gov. Hochul on her $1B Medicaid money grab. \n\nInstead of supporting low-income hospitals and counties, Hochul siphoned off critical health care funds to patch her bloated budget. It\u2019s disgraceful.\n\nNew Yorkers deserve better than this kind of Albany corruption.",
