                "text": "Happy 60th Birthday, Medicaid! For six decades, Medicaid has provided millions of seniors, single mothers, children, and the I/DD community with the care they desperately need, and I will continue to fight for stability in the program to ensure coverage for future generations. https://t.co/NKhHK74twa",
