                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m one of several Republicans who\u2019ve signed onto legislation to extend the ACA subsidies for a year. Those subsidies were meant to be temporary, created during COVID when businesses were shut down and families lost coverage. \n\nThe ACA has not done anything to make healthcare more affordable, and we need to get serious about comprehensive healthcare reform.",
