                "text": "Grateful to host CMS Administrator Dr. Mehmet Oz in the Hudson Valley today for a productive discussion with our local hospitals and community health centers. We talked about protecting Medicare, strengthening Medicaid for those who need it most, tackling workforce shortages, lowering costs, and improving care for seniors and underserved families across NY-17.",
