                "text": "The expiration for the enhanced premium tax credit, put in place by Democrats during COVID, is slated for the end of this year. This will impact 22+ million Americans and they will see a spike in their premiums. \n\nI am working with my colleagues across the aisle on a plan to extend the premium tax credit, enact serious reforms, and eliminate zero premium plans. \n\nThis is common sense. It will prevent a fiscal cliff for millions of families while reforming the broken, expensive Obamacare system.",
